NesPrgRom:3F23C:syscall_rti_return:[HIGH 2026-10-28] Where every syscall returns. syscall_dispatch ($F226) pushes $F2, $3C and P (PHP), then JMP ($FFFE); irq_handler runs the syscall, and its RTI pulls P and PC = $F23C. Copies the result $66/$67 into regA ($08/$09). Reached only by RTI, so no descent sees it (native_discover seeds it).
