NesPrgRom:B9C2:terrain_strength_mult_table:[ROM-DATA 2026-06-10] Word terrain-defense multipliers [90,20,10,0] indexed by terrain class (ai_terrain_strength_term); the chaos string follows in ROM.
NesPrgRom:B9F8:combat_command_jumptab:[ROM-DATA 2026-06-10] Word-ptr JUMP table of combat command handlers ($A90E,$A96C,$A9FB,...); indexed by combat_command_dispatch_loop_per_unit via the selected command.
